            "image_avata": "shopify://shop_images/8b2e9dc2d475e8ab04325735ce0dfd32c88361a1.png",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>\"I honestly didn’t expect these little dino ducks to become my son’s favorite bath toy so quickly. Bath time used to be a struggle every single night — crying, refusing to get in the tub, the whole thing. Since we got these, he literally runs to the bathroom holding his tiny towel and asks for his ‘dino duck friends.\"</p>",
