        },
        "testimonial_item_jXQ3Vj": {
          "type": "_testimonial_item",
          "settings": {
            "image_avata": "shopify://shop_images/0b91cc41357a1611e67ff527770f3b13bd8e9013.png",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>“As a mom of two toddlers, I’m always looking for toys that keep them entertained without screens, and these have honestly been amazing. The dinosaur design is adorable in person, and both of my kids instantly became obsessed with them.”</p>",
            "title": "Sophia L.",
            "pos": "",
            "rating": 5
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "testimonial_item_n7MMdC": {
          "type": "_testimonial_item",
          "settings": {
            "image_avata": "shopify://shop_images/e3c2c7c5a1a18c07e1a6c4ae9a0fd4c188f39443.png",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>“These are SO much cuter in real life than in the photos. The packaging was adorable and felt surprisingly premium for the price. I bought them as a birthday gift for my niece, but after seeing them in person, I ended up ordering another set for my own daughter immediately.”</p>",
            "title": "Emily R.",
            "pos": "",
            "rating": 5
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "testimonial_item_Be9ck9": {
          "type": "_testimonial_item",
          "name": "Testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image_avata": "shopify://shop_images/model-with-leather-jacket-over-shoulders.jpg",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>“The moment I opened the package, I could tell the quality was better than most toys in this price range. The colors are soft and aesthetic, the material feels safe and durable, and the dinosaur costumes are ridiculously cute. My little boy carries them everywhere — bath tub, couch, stroller, even bedtime.”</p>",
            "title": "Emily R.",
            "pos": "",
            "rating": 5
          },
          "blocks": {}
